    "background_story": "Cruz was once a brilliant engineer, renowned for his innovative designs and solutions. However, a tragic accident left him with a debilitating injury that impaired his motor skills and cognitive abilities. Despite the challenges, Cruz refused to give up. He redirected his energy towards developing assistive technologies that could help others with similar impairments. His creations, such as smart canes and prosthetic limbs, revolutionized the lives of many. Cruz's own impairment became the driving force behind his groundbreaking work, earning him recognition as a pioneer in the field of accessibility. His determination and resilience inspired countless individuals to reevaluate their own limitations and strive for greatness despite adversity.",
